      "id": "at-glance",
      "title": "At a glance",
      "body": "Xin lỗi answers the traveler question \"Excuse me / sorry\" in small service and first-contact moments. This helps you get attention, pass by someone, or apologize for a small mistake. This is the safe all-purpose phrase for passing by, starting a question, or apologizing lightly. Its job is asking for one clear help action before adding more words. Expect a slower repeat, a pointed explanation, or a switch to writing; then use Explore next if the reply creates another small task.",
      "presentation": "plain-text"
    },
